      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Petitioner has been made an accused in connection with Chandankiyari (Bhojudih) P.S. Case No.\n210/2023, registered under Sections 376/ 506 of the Indian Penal Code, pending in the Court of Ms.\nSamirah Khan, learned J.M.F.C., Bokaro.\nThe petitioner is said to have established consensual physical relationship with the informant, who is a major lady.\nIt is alleged that when the marriage of the informant was fixed elsewhere, she was threatened by the petitioner to make their intimate photographs viral.\nIt was submitted that at best a case under section 506 of the Indian Penal Code will be made out against the petitioner which is bailable in nature.\nRegard being had to the facts and circumstance of the case, the petitioner named above, is directed to be released on bail on furnishing bail bond of Rs. 20,000/- (Twenty Thousand only) with two sureties of the like amount each to the satisfaction of Ms. Samirah Khan, learned J.M.F.C., Bokaro or her successor in connection with Chandankiyari (Bhojudih) P.S. Case No. 210/2023.",
